Why GPL-3.0: the app links espeak-ng (GPL-3.0) and, when enabled, piper
(GPL-3.0) — the same licensing position Speech Note (dsnote) takes with its
espeak-ng/piper engines. MIT-licensed dependencies (SwiftCrossUI, ONNX
Runtime) are compatible as libraries. Model weights are licensed separately:
Kokoro and its G2P dictionaries are Apache-2.0; Supertonic's model is
OpenRAIL-M. Those are model licenses, not code licenses, and are listed in
the README.
